<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct cotton imports fall 16.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct cotton imports fall 16.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's cotton imports reached 550,000 tonnes in the first 10 months of 1996, down 16.7 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Imports in October alone were 50,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>China's cotton exports in the first 10 months slumped 78.5 percent to 4,493 tonnes from 20,930 tonnes in the same year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports were 452 tonnes in October alone.</p>
</text>
